  "aeroworks.ponder.console_configure.header": "配置控制模块",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_configure.text_1": "潜行右击以打开其配置",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_configure.text_2": "按键绑定、频率等选项均按控制模块分别设置",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_configure.text_3": "潜行右击空气可配置手持的模块",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_control.header": "操控控制台",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_control.text_1": "空手右击以开始操控",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_control.text_2": "键盘和鼠标输入将带动已安装的控制模块",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_control.text_3": "每个方向都在各自的无线红石信号终端频率上发送信号",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_control.text_4": "发送的信号强度与控制模块的偏移量相对应",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_control.text_5": "向相反方向移动时在第二个频率上发送信号",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_control.text_6": "按 [Esc] 结束操控",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_deck.header": "控制台组",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_deck.text_1": "当多个控制台相互接触时...",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_deck.text_2": "...它们可以被一同操控",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_deck.text_3": "分开放置的控制台仍是独立的操控站",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_deck.text_4": "同一时间只能有一名玩家操控一组控制台",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_heads.header": "堆叠控制模块",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_heads.text_1": "某些模块自带一个小型插槽",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_heads.text_2": "手持小型模块右击即可安装头部",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_heads.text_3": "头部会随其下方的控制模块一同移动",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_heads.text_4": "它们的输入与其他控制模块一样工作",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_mounting.header": "在控制台上安装控制模块",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_mounting.text_1": "控制台提供用于安装控制模块的插槽",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_mounting.text_2": "手持模块右击插槽即可安装",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_mounting.text_3": "同一控制台可安装多个模块",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_mounting.text_4": "小型模块也可安装在大型插槽中",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_mounting.text_5": "可使用扳手拆下模块",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_mounting.text_6": "拆下时模块会保留其设置",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_restyle.header": "模块样式",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_restyle.text_1": "某些模块拥有多种样式",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_restyle.text_2": "手持样式材料右击已安装的模块即可更换其样式",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_restyle.text_3": "更换样式后模块会保留其设置",
  "aeroworks.ponder.console_restyle.text_4": "合成配方可对模块物品进行相同的更换",
  "aeroworks.ponder.mechanical_servo.header": "使用机械舵机控制旋转角度",
  "aeroworks.ponder.mechanical_servo.text_1": "机械舵机根据输入的红石信号输出对应的旋转角度",
  "aeroworks.ponder.mechanical_servo.text_2": "右击以配置其旋转范围",
  "aeroworks.ponder.mechanical_servo.text_3": "信号强度最大时，舵机旋转至范围终点",
  "aeroworks.ponder.mechanical_servo.text_4": "舵机旋转至与信号强度成正比的角度",
  "aeroworks.ponder.mechanical_servo.text_5": "响应新信号前，舵机会先完成当前的旋转",
  "aeroworks.ponder.stepper_servo.header": "使用步进舵机控制旋转角度",
  "aeroworks.ponder.stepper_servo.text_1": "步进舵机旋转至与信号强度成正比的角度",
  "aeroworks.ponder.stepper_servo.text_2": "右击以设置每一步的角度",
  "aeroworks.ponder.stepper_servo.text_3": "信号越强，步进舵机旋转越多",
  "aeroworks.ponder.stepper_servo.text_4": "响应新信号前，步进舵机会先完成当前的旋转",
  "aeroworks.ponder.stepper_servo.text_5": "之后才会转向新的目标",
  "aeroworks.ponder.stepper_servo_dual.header": "控制步进舵机的旋转方向",
  "aeroworks.ponder.stepper_servo_dual.text_1": "步进舵机可接收来自任意一侧的信号",
  "aeroworks.ponder.stepper_servo_dual.text_2": "一侧的信号使其向一个方向旋转",
  "aeroworks.ponder.stepper_servo_dual.text_3": "另一侧的信号使其向相反方向旋转",
  "aeroworks.ponder.stepper_servo_dual.text_4": "两侧同时充能时，舵机没有目标并保持当前位置",
